Strangely Charming — Ears-compatible skin rendering for Horizon

The Ears skin formats and feature geometry are designed by exa/unascribed and
Ears contributors. Specification/reference:
https://git.sleeping.town/exa/Ears-Fifth-Edition
Reference revision: 3d42f726b05e687c096e7a4d6b427ae6e51768ec2c94ad1430721daec720b64a

This bundle contains a Rust implementation and native Horizon adapters, not the
Java Ears mod or its game binaries. Ears and Minecraft are names of their
respective projects/owners. This is not an official Ears or Minecraft release.
No Minecraft textures, account credentials, or player skins are bundled.

The source packaging tool is adapted from the MIT-licensed Horizon native mod
template (Horizon Veinminer contributors / Horizon native mod contributors).
Its license is included as LICENSE.template.

